{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Aharon shall burn upon it.</b> Not specifically Aharon, for the incense may be offered even by an ordinary priest. The verse links the incense to the lamps, as it is written: when he tends the lamps he shall burn it. And we find that the lamps are valid even by an ordinary priest, as it is written: 'in the Tent of Meeting Aharon and his sons shall arrange it.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:09.616204859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}